{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45624","headline":"塞上曲二首 一 · 贯休","name":"塞上曲二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦袷胡儿黑如漆，骑羊上冰如箭疾。\n蒲萄酒白雕腊红，苜蓿根甜沙鼠出。\n单于右臂何须断，天子昭昭本如日。\n一握黳髯一握丝，须知只爲平戎术。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}